        "original_id": "95e88c91-ca7d-51bd-8f0d-e61a20050278",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Colin Morgan, Charlotte Spencer, Nathan Appleby, Charlotte Appleby\n- TV series: The Living and the Dead, Merlin, Humans, The Fall\n- Films: Testament of Youth, Legend\n- Plays: The Tempest\n\nFacts:\n- Colin Morgan was born on 1 January 1986 and is a British/Irish film, television, theatre, and radio actor.\n- Colin Morgan is best known for playing the title character in the BBC fantasy series Merlin.\n- Colin Morgan had the lead role in The Living and the Dead and main roles in Humans and The Fall.\n- Colin Morgan played Ariel in the stage production of The Tempest.\n- Colin Morgan also had film roles in Testament of Youth and Legend.\n- In The Living and the Dead, Nathan Appleby is played by Colin Morgan and Charlotte Appleby is played by Charlotte Spencer.\n- In The Living and the Dead, Nathan Appleby and his wife Charlotte Appleby live on a farm believed to be at the centre of numerous supernatural occurrences.",
